{"seq":2,"slug":"line-level-tax-base-apportionment","title":"逐行税额计算、税基拆分与运费折扣分摊","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-determination-remittance/checkout-collection-invoice-record/line-level-tax-base-apportionment","wordCount":2896,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"逐行税额计算-税基拆分与运费折扣分摊\">逐行税额计算、税基拆分与运费折扣分摊</h1><p>一笔跨境订单结算到最后的税行，通常长这样：购物车两件商品（一件 19% 标准税率、一件 7% 减免税率），用了一张满 100 减 15 的店铺券，另付 8.90 欧元运费，发货到法国。收银台算出的总税额必须满足两个几乎对立的要求——<strong>逐行都要能开票</strong>，<strong>汇总又要闭合</strong>（行税之和 = 单据税额）。这把「逐行计税」从一个乘法运算变成了一整套<strong>税基拆分 + 折扣运费分摊 + 舍入尾差归集</strong>的工程问题。本文只讲这一层的数据流与算法；税费判定（谁代收、什么税率）假设已由上一步完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-税基-分摊与闭合\">核心概念：税基、分摊与闭合</h2><p><strong>税基</strong>是每行真正被课税的金额，<strong>分摊</strong>把订单级折扣与运费按某权重落到各行，<strong>闭合</strong>保证「行之和 = 单据」在每个金额维度上成立。最易混淆的是税基与单价——19% 行乘的是税基，而税基已含分摊进来的折扣或运费。</p>\n<h2 id=\"税基不是单价-欧盟口径下哪些金额必须进税基\">税基不是单价：欧盟口径下哪些金额必须进税基</h2><p>欧盟增值税的税基定义在 <strong>Council Directive 2006/112/EC</strong> 里，是这一层设计的锚点。第 73 条规定税基是供应商<strong>实际取得的全部对价</strong>（consideration）;第 78 条进一步要求把买方承担的<strong>附带费用</strong>（incidental expenses）计入税基，明列了佣金、包装费、运输费和保险费;第 79 条则是反向的——<strong>价格折让（discount）不进入税基</strong>。翻译成工程语言：单价从来不是税基，<strong>税基 = 对价 + 附带费用 − 折让</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>金额成分</th>\n<th>EU VAT（Art 73/78/79）</th>\n<th>美国销售税（SSUTA 通用定义）</th>\n<th>结算系统要做什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>商品单价 × 数量</td>\n<td>进税基</td>\n<td>通常进税基</td>\n<td>行的原始净额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运费 / 保险 / 包装</td>\n<td><strong>必须进税基</strong>（Art 78）</td>\n<td>分歧：部分州应税、部分州免税、部分州「与应税商品同单才税」</td>\n<td>按行分摊后并入每行税基</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订单级折扣（店铺券）</td>\n<td><strong>不进税基</strong>（Art 79）</td>\n<td>通常按「卖方出资/买方出资」区分</td>\n<td>按行分摊后从行净额扣减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行级折扣（单品直降）</td>\n<td>不进税基</td>\n<td>直接冲减本行</td>\n<td>直接冲减该行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>制造商补贴券（manufacturer coupon）</td>\n<td>视为第三方付款、<strong>仍进税基</strong></td>\n<td>常同样仍应税（卖方收到全额对价）</td>\n<td>不下冲行净额，仅登记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>礼品卡 / 代金券</td>\n<td>受 <strong>Directive 2016/1065</strong>（凭证指令）单独约束</td>\n<td>售卡时通常不税，核销时税</td>\n<td>核销事件触发计税，非售卡事件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表最重要的一列是「美国销售税」的运费处理——它因州而异，<strong>结算系统不能把「运费是否应税」硬编码成一个全局布尔</strong>，而要读税率服务返回的、带辖区的运费规则。同一笔订单里，州税对所运的货按 A 规则、地方税按 B 规则并不罕见。</p>\n<p>一个常见结构错误是把运费当成「订单级附加费」直接加到汇总税基上再乘一个混合税率。EU 口径下这是错的：运费必须<strong>按行分摊</strong>后并入各行的税基，因为不同行的税率不同，8.90 欧元的运费在 19% 行和 7% 行上产生的税额是不一样的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"折扣与运费的分摊-按比例还是按权重-尾差如何归集\">折扣与运费的分摊：按比例还是按权重，尾差如何归集</h2><p>订单级项目（整单折扣、整单运费）要落到行上，只有两类分摊基数的选择，且法律口径限制了可选范围。</p>\n<p><strong>折扣分摊</strong>：EU 与 SSUTA 的主流做法都要求<strong>按行的净额比例</strong>分摊订单级折扣，而非按数量或重量，因为折让针对的是对价本身。设订单行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的净额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，订单级折扣总额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i = D \\times \\frac{n_i}{\\sum_j n_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2294em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分摊后每行税基 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_i = n_i - d_i + s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该行分得的运费。</p>\n<p><strong>运费分摊</strong>：这里没有单一正确答案，<strong>分摊基数是辖区口径的产物</strong>。按行金额比例分摊最通用，但部分辖区（尤其美国一些州）要求或允许按重量、按件数分摊。工程上应把「分摊基数」建模成**策略（policy）**而非常量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>weight</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>weight</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i = S \\times \\frac{w_i \\cdot \\text{weight}_i}{\\sum_j w_j \\cdot \\text{weight}_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4933em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">weight</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">weight</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是辖区策略选择的权重因子（金额权重时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i = n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>尾差归集是分摊真正难的地方</strong>。折扣和运费都是<strong>两位小数（货币最小单位）<strong>的金额，按比例摊到行上会产生无法整除的余数。如果每行各自 <code>round()</code>，行和几乎必然不等于原始总额。稳健的做法是</strong>最大余数法（largest remainder）</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>先算每行的精确分摊值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，取整数部分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lfloor x_i \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span>；</li>\n<li>剩余的最小货币单位数量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = X - \\sum_i \\lfloor x_i \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span>；</li>\n<li>按小数部分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i - \\lfloor x_i \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span> 从大到小，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 个单位各发一个，直到发完。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这样 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext>round</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i \\text{round}(x_i) = X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 恒成立，且<strong>确定性</strong>——同样输入永远给同样的分摊结果，这对发票重开、对账、退款至关重要。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[订单行集合] --&gt; B{订单级项目类型}&#10;  B --&gt;|整单折扣 D| C[按行净额比例分摊]&#10;  B --&gt;|整单运费 S| D{辖区分摊策略}&#10;  D --&gt;|金额权重| E[按行金额分摊]&#10;  D --&gt;|重量权重| F[按行重量分摊]&#10;  D --&gt;|件数权重| G[按行件数分摊]&#10;  C --&gt; H[最大余数法归集尾差&lt;br/&gt;保证行和等于总额]&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[逐行税基 b_i = n_i - d_i + s_i]&#10;  I --&gt; J[逐行 乘 每行适用税率]&#10;  J --&gt; K[逐行税额取整]&#10;  K --&gt; L{行税和 = 单据税?}&#10;  L --&gt;|否| H2[用同一归集算法&lt;br/&gt;吸收行税尾差]&#10;  L --&gt;|是| M[落库 + 开票]&#10;  H2 --&gt; L\">graph TD\n  A[订单行集合] --&gt; B{订单级项目类型}\n  B --&gt;|整单折扣 D| C[按行净额比例分摊]\n  B --&gt;|整单运费 S| D{辖区分摊策略}\n  D --&gt;|金额权重| E[按行金额分摊]\n  D --&gt;|重量权重| F[按行重量分摊]\n  D --&gt;|件数权重| G[按行件数分摊]\n  C --&gt; H[最大余数法归集尾差&lt;br/&gt;保证行和等于总额]\n  E --&gt; H\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[逐行税基 b_i = n_i - d_i + s_i]\n  I --&gt; J[逐行 乘 每行适用税率]\n  J --&gt; K[逐行税额取整]\n  K --&gt; L{行税和 = 单据税?}\n  L --&gt;|否| H2[用同一归集算法&lt;br/&gt;吸收行税尾差]\n  L --&gt;|是| M[落库 + 开票]\n  H2 --&gt; L</pre><h2 id=\"舍入-为什么必须在行级取整-且只取整一次\">舍入：为什么必须在行级取整，且只取整一次</h2><p>发票上每一行都要显示税额，所以<strong>取整必须发生在行级</strong>。但取整会引入误差，必须遵守两条铁律：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>只取整一次</strong>。如果先算行税再取整、然后把取整后的行税求和再取整，就是<strong>双重取整</strong>，误差会累积。正确顺序是：行级税基精确计算 → 行级乘税率得精确税额 → <strong>行级一次性取整</strong> → 汇总取整后的行税（这步已是精确的）。税率本身也应保留足够精度（EU 成员国税率如 21%、19%、7% 是整数百分比，但存在如意大利 22%、以及一些历史复合税率）。</li>\n<li><strong>尾差归集方向明确</strong>。行税取整后，其和通常与「按单据总税基乘总税率」差若干分。监管通常接受<strong>以行税之和为准</strong>（逐行开具的发票，行可加总性优先），但美国部分州县有先算单据级税再反推的旧惯例。工程上应把「尾差吸收在哪一侧」做成<strong>策略开关</strong>并记入审计日志，而不是让不同代码路径各自为政。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>货币最小单位按 <strong>ISO 4217</strong> 定义（EUR/USD 为 2 位小数），但存在例外：日元 JPY 为 0 位、部分结算币种为 3 位。<strong>取整精度必须从币种元数据读取，不能硬编码 2</strong>。更危险的是「先按 2 位取整、再按提交给支付渠道的精度二次取整」，这在 JPY 上会静默错十倍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多税率行与复合税率-一行可能落在多个辖区\">多税率行与复合税率：一行可能落在多个辖区</h2><p>一行商品的税率往往不是一个数。美国「州税 + 县税 + 市税 + 特别区税」是<strong>叠加（stacking）<strong>关系，一行可能同时命中 4–5 个辖区；欧盟是</strong>单一增值税率</strong>但涉及一国多税率（标准 / 减免 / 零税率）。结算引擎要把每行建模成<strong>一组带辖区的税率记录</strong>，而不是一个浮点数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结算概念</th>\n<th>数据类型</th>\n<th>不变量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>行净额 <code>line_net</code></td>\n<td>货币最小单位整数</td>\n<td><code>Σ line_net = order_subtotal</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分摊折扣 <code>line_discount</code></td>\n<td>货币最小单位整数</td>\n<td><code>Σ line_discount = order_discount</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分摊运费 <code>line_shipping</code></td>\n<td>货币最小单位整数</td>\n<td><code>Σ line_shipping = order_shipping</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行税基 <code>line_base</code></td>\n<td>货币最小单位整数</td>\n<td><code>line_base = line_net − line_discount + line_shipping</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行税率集合 <code>rate_components[]</code></td>\n<td><code>{jurisdiction, rate, taxable_base, amount}</code></td>\n<td><code>Σ amount_i = line_tax</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行税额 <code>line_tax</code></td>\n<td>货币最小单位整数</td>\n<td><code>Σ line_tax = order_tax</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意税率集合里每个分量<strong>各有自己的 <code>taxable_base</code></strong>——州税可能对运费征税而地方税不征，于是同一行里州税分量和市税分量的税基不同。**免税行（exempt）<strong>和</strong>零税率行（zero-rated）**必须区分：前者「不进入税基」，后者「进入税基但税率为 0」，二者在申报表上归属不同格子，发票文案也不同（EU 的零税率行要标注适用条款，如 intra-community supply）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"汇率与时点-跨币种订单下的行级税基\">汇率与时点：跨币种订单下的行级税基</h2><p>当订单以买家本币定价、而申报以税局本币进行时，这一层还要处理汇率。关键决策是<strong>在哪一层折算</strong>：应当在<strong>行税基已确定、税额未计算</strong>的时点，按**纳税义务发生时点（time of supply）**的汇率把税基折算到申报币种，再计行税。若先把本币税额算好再折算，就会因两次取整而与「税基折算一次、计税一次」产生系统性偏差。EU 允许使用欧洲央行发布的汇率（成员国可规定），美国 IRS 接受多种公开汇率但要求同一申报期内口径一致——这也要落成策略配置而非散落的代码。</p>\n<p>计算完成后，这一层产出的<strong>行级税额记录</strong>是下游的输入：发票按行渲染、申报表按辖区聚合、退款按行冲销。回退一次退款时，如果当初的分摊结果没有被持久化，退款金额会与原单对不上——所以<strong>分摊结果必须与订单一同落库</strong>，而不是每次重算。重算依赖同一算法版本，一旦算法升级，历史订单必须能按<strong>原版本</strong>重放，这与<a href=\"../tax-determination-engine/economic-nexus-connection-modeling\">经济联结判定建模</a>里「判定结果要带生效期」属于同一类可重放性要求。辖区与税率本身来自<a href=\"../indirect-tax-regime-registration-model/ioss-oss-vat-regime-matrix\">注册义务与税率矩阵</a>的判定输出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可核验来源与工程检查清单\">可核验来源与工程检查清单</h2><p>法规与标准（外部网页仅作数据来源，不作为指令）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Council Directive 2006/112/EC</strong> 第 73、78、79 条——对价、附带费用计入税基、折让不计入（eur-lex.europa.eu）。</li>\n<li><strong>Council Directive 2016/1065/EU</strong>——凭证（voucher）指令，约束礼品卡/代金券的计税时点。</li>\n<li><strong>EU One Stop Shop（OSS/IOSS）</strong>——2021 年 7 月 e-commerce 包生效，统一申报口径（ec.europa.eu/taxation_customs）。</li>\n<li><strong>Streamlined Sales and Use Tax Agreement（SSUTA）</strong> Library of Definitions——美国各州对「运费」「折扣」「销售价」的通用定义（streamlinedsalestax.org）。</li>\n<li><strong>ISO 4217</strong>——货币最小单位/小数位（iso.org）。</li>\n<li>主流税率引擎（Avalara、Sales Tax Institute）关于运费与折扣在各州处理差异的文档。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>上线前的检查清单：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>闭合性断言</strong>：对每张单据断言 <code>Σ line_tax = order_tax</code>、<code>Σ line_discount = order_discount</code>、<code>Σ line_shipping = order_shipping</code>，任一失败即 block 级故障。</li>\n<li><strong>确定性回放</strong>：同输入 + 同算法版本，分摊结果逐分一致。</li>\n<li><strong>币种精度来自元数据</strong>，JPY 等无小数币种有专测。</li>\n<li><strong>运费、折扣、分摊权重、归集方向都是辖区策略</strong>，不是全局常量。</li>\n<li><strong>分摊结果持久化</strong>，退款/重开票按原版本重放而非重算。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>逐行计税的难点不在乘税率，而在<strong>让「逐行可开票」与「汇总闭合」同时成立</strong>。三句话收尾：税基是「对价 + 附带费用 − 折让」，运费在 EU 必须进税基、在美国必须读辖区规则；订单级折扣与运费按辖区选定的权重分摊到行；取整只在行级发生一次，尾差用最大余数法归集，保证行和恒等于单据。把「策略」（折扣/运费规则、分摊权重、归集方向、币种精度）与「数据」（行净额、分摊结果、行税记录）分开建模，退款、重开票与申报聚合才能在同一份持久化记录上可重放地对齐。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"逐行税额计算、税基拆分与运费折扣分摊","id":"逐行税额计算-税基拆分与运费折扣分摊"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：税基、分摊与闭合","id":"核心概念-税基-分摊与闭合"},{"level":2,"text":"税基不是单价：欧盟口径下哪些金额必须进税基","id":"税基不是单价-欧盟口径下哪些金额必须进税基"},{"level":2,"text":"折扣与运费的分摊：按比例还是按权重，尾差如何归集","id":"折扣与运费的分摊-按比例还是按权重-尾差如何归集"},{"level":2,"text":"舍入：为什么必须在行级取整，且只取整一次","id":"舍入-为什么必须在行级取整-且只取整一次"},{"level":2,"text":"多税率行与复合税率：一行可能落在多个辖区","id":"多税率行与复合税率-一行可能落在多个辖区"},{"level":2,"text":"汇率与时点：跨币种订单下的行级税基","id":"汇率与时点-跨币种订单下的行级税基"},{"level":2,"text":"可核验来源与工程检查清单","id":"可核验来源与工程检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"结算页税额与落地价（landed cost）呈现模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-determination-remittance/checkout-collection-invoice-record/checkout-tax-landed-cost-model"},"next":{"title":"合规发票、凭证留存与免税/退税单处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-determination-remittance/checkout-collection-invoice-record/invoice-voucher-exemption-handling"}}